bslab bya," i.e., a trainee of Sangs rgyas bzang po (ID:6042) as the author.</note><idno type="APIS">4612</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4614"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gnas lugs ngo sprod kyi gdams pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">གནས་ལུགས་ངོ་སྤྲོད་ཀྱི་གདམས་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shes rab 'bum gyis mdzad pa'i gnas lugs ngo sprod kyi gdams pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zab lam thog mar dge ba'i khrid kyi ngo sprod</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">snyan brgyud gsal ba'i me long gnas lugs ngo sprod kyi gdams pa mtha' drug sgo 'byed kyi lde mig nyams myong gsal ba'i sgron ma</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mtha' drug sgo 'byed kyi lde mig gnas lugs ngo sprod kyi gdams pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1210-01-01">after 1210</date><author ref="person:4608">brag ram pa shes rab 'bum</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">4614</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4616"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i sgrub thabs rnal 'byor bcu gnyis pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">དཔལ་དུས་ཀྱི་འཁོར་ལོའི་སྒྲུབ་ཐབས་རྣལ་འབྱོར་བཅུ་གཉིས་པ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1193-01-01" notAfter="1383-12-31">after 1193 before 1383</date><author ref="person:4608">brag ram pa shes rab 'bum</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">4616</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5633"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">(undefined/unidentified sūtra)</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sūtra</title><idno type="APIS">5633</idno></bibl></listBibl><listPlace><place xml:id="place5572"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">brag ram</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">བྲག་རམ</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">brag ram gyi gtsug lag khang</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal ldan brag ram gyi gtsug lag khang chen po</pl