<pb n="1b"/><lb n="6b8"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-21-36" status="finalized">gsuM pa la 3 las ¦ gzhan lugs dgag pa ni | <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3868">kha cig</rs><note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3868">pa tshab</rs></note> na re <note type="gloss"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:5633">dgongs pa nges 'grel</rs></note> 'du byed khaMs dang don daM mtshan nyid ni | <pb n="7a"/><lb n="7a1"/> cig dang tha dad bral pa'i mtshan nyid la ces pa ltar | cig dang tha dad las grol ba de nyid dang gzhan du brjod du med pa'o zhes smra'o || de ni ye nas ma yin te |</seg>

