<lb n="8a5"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-29-43" status="finalized">du ba gsar byung gi ngo bo tsam me las byung par nges pas ma byung pa'i dogs pa chod pa na du <choice><orig>‹ba›</orig><reg>ba</reg></choice> gsar byung gi bye brag <expan>thams cad</expan> me las ma byung ba'i dogs pa chod pa bzhin zhes grags pa la dpang pa dag <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">rtsang</rs></note> <note type="editorial"> Tentatively identified as gTsang nag pa (ID:3839), but could be gTsang nags phug pa (ID:6640) </note> bzhed do ||</seg>

<seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-29-44" status="finalized"><lb n="8a6"/> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3892">chos rje <note type="gloss">sa skya</note> paN Ti ta</rs> ni skyes ma thag pa'i rig pa rgyu dngos por med pa las skye ba ni yul dus nges par snang ba'i rtags kyis khegs la × | beMs po dbang po dang lus dang dbugs 'byung rngub sogs de dag tshgos pa las skye na | gang rung 1 ma tshang na rig pa mi skye bar 'gyur la × |</seg>


 <lb n="8b2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-29-45" status="finalized">dang po ni <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3868">kha 1</rs><note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3868">pa tshab</rs></note> shes brjod gzhal bya las 'das pa'o zhes pa ni × |</seg>


<lb n="8b5"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-29-46" status="finalized">yang <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">rtsang nag</rs></note> <expan>don dam</expan> rnaM par dpyod pa'i blo skyes pa na × | dpyad bya <expan>don dam</expan> pa'i bden pa zhes pa ci yang ma rnyed pas der 'dzin pa'i blo zad pa la <expan>don dam</expan> bden pa <expan>rtogs so</expan> zhes tha snyad byas te × |</seg>

