 <lb n="9b1"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0312-29-51" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3810">kha 1</rs> <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3810">gangs she</rs></note> dag du ma ni 1 yin par 'gal bas sbyor ba dang po 'thad la × | du ma la 1 yod par 'brel bas sbyor ba phyi ma 'thad do zhe'o ||</seg>

