 <lb n="47b2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex019072025-12-0315-38-24" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3839">kha cig</rs> <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">rtsang nag</rs></note> rten 'brel <lb n="47b3"/> rang bzhin gyis ma skyes pa nyid bden gnyis yin la ¦ de phan tshun dang so so la ltos te dbu ma yin te ¦ yod med kyi mtha' las grol ba'i phyir ces 'chad do ||</seg></ab>




         
